 m is schedule-only because demos may show published work. Co-located work
 shops run their own calls\, which are not tracked. Papers are 14-page LNC
 S\, double-blind\; award papers are invited to an IJCV special issue. L r
 eflects 378 accepted papers. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition,Deep Representation Learni
 ng,Machine Learning
URL:https://accv2026.org/
LOCATION:Osaka\, Japan
END:VEVENT
