  & Tell explicitly uses 23:59 AoE and requires a two-page paper\, video\,
  and interactive demonstration. The Feb 16 update is not a fresh submissi
 on route. XL reflects the official description of more than 2\,000 annual
  attendees\; the ICORE rank and historical acceptance fields describe the
  main conference\, not its demonstration track.
CATEGORIES:Signal Processing,Machine Learning,Deep Representation Learning,
 Natural Language Processing & LLMs
